            <ArticleTitle>Correction to: Optimized synthesis of novel prenyl ferulate performed by feruloyl esterases from Myceliophthora thermophila in microemulsions.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>511</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1007/s00253-017-8631-8</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>After publication of the original article, authors found that there has been a minor mistake in the units of kcat and kcat/Km in Table 2. The units should be 103 min-1 g-1 FAE for kcat and mM-1 min-1 g-1 FAE for kcat/Km. This correction does not affect any conclusions drawn within the article.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
